.TH KEEL\-PVE 8 "2026-10-03" "keel-pve 0.1.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
keel\-pve \- signed Keel Linux container templates on a Proxmox VE host
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keel\-pve update
.br
.B keel\-pve available
.br
.B keel\-pve download
.I STORAGE TEMPLATE
.br
.B keel\-pve list
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B keel\-pve
makes Keel Linux templates available to
.BR pct (1)
and to the Create CT dialog of the Proxmox VE web interface. It fetches
the Keel template index, verifies it, and downloads a template into a
storage's
.B vztmpl
content, where Proxmox VE lists it like any other template.
.PP
It changes no file of pve\-manager. The Templates download dialog of the
web interface lists only the sources built into pve\-manager, so Keel
templates do not appear there; they appear in the template list of the
storage once downloaded.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B update
Fetches
.I aplinfo.dat.gz
and
.I aplinfo.dat.asc
from
.IR https://releases.keellinux.org/pve/ ,
unpacks the index and verifies the detached signature with
.PP
.RS 7
sqv \-\-keyring /usr/share/keyrings/keel\-archive\-keyring.gpg aplinfo.dat.asc aplinfo.dat
.RE
.IP
the same call
.B pveam update
makes with its own keyring. Every record must parse the way pveam parses
it. Only then are the index and its signature stored in
.IR /var/lib/keel\-pve/ ;
a refused update keeps the index that was there.
.TP
.B available
Lists the templates of the stored index: package, version, template file
name and description. The stored index is verified again first.
.TP
.BI download " STORAGE TEMPLATE"
.I TEMPLATE
is a package name such as
.BR keel\-web ,
which selects its newest version, or a template file name from
.BR available .
The storage must have
.B vztmpl
content (\fBpvesm status \-\-content vztmpl\fR). The destination is the
path
.B pvesm path
.IR STORAGE :vztmpl/ FILE
returns, never a guessed one, and
.I FILE
is the name the index gives. The template is written into a new private
directory that
.BR mktemp (1)
creates in that directory, its sha512 is compared with the signed index,
and only a match is renamed into place; a symlink at the final name is
replaced, never written through. A
.I Location
must be an https URL whose last segment is a template file name. A mismatch is refused and leaves the
storage as it was. A template already present with the right sha512 is not
fetched again.
.TP
.B list
Shows the Keel template volumes of every storage with
.B vztmpl
content, and marks those the current index does not list.
.SH APT SOURCE
keel\-pve and keel\-archive\-keyring are upgraded from the Keel archive,
.IR https://archive.keellinux.org .
When no line of
.I /etc/apt/sources.list
or of a
.I *.list
or
.I *.sources
file in
.I /etc/apt/sources.list.d
names it outside a comment, every subcommand first prints on standard
error the file to create,
.IR /etc/apt/sources.list.d/keel.sources ,
and its deb822 block, with
.B Suites: trixie\-testing
while the package is published there. The exit status is unchanged.
.SH LIMITS
curl gives up after 30 seconds connecting, 120 seconds on each index file
and two hours on a template. A command that finds the state directory
locked by another waits 10 minutes at most.
.SH TIMER
.B keel\-pve\-update.timer
runs
.B keel\-pve update
once a day. It is installed disabled:
.PP
.RS 4
systemctl enable \-\-now keel\-pve\-update.timer
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
success
.TP
.B 1
usage error
.TP
.B 2
update or download run without root
.TP
.B 3
the index does not verify or does not parse
.TP
.B 4
a transfer failed
.TP
.B 5
no index yet, unknown template, or a storage pvesm does not resolve
.TP
.B 6
the downloaded template does not match the sha512 of the index
.TP
.B 7
a file could not be written
.TP
.B 8
the keyring of keel\-archive\-keyring is missing
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/apt/preferences.d/keel\-pve
the apt pin this package installs: from the Keel archive only keel\-pve and
keel\-archive\-keyring, priority 500; every other package, priority \-1
.TP
.I /usr/share/keyrings/keel\-archive\-keyring.gpg
the Keel archive key, from keel\-archive\-keyring; primary key fingerprint
AD0964BE3F09DED469A3B6B2148E951314703180
.TP
.I /var/lib/keel\-pve/aplinfo.dat
.TQ
.I /var/lib/keel\-pve/aplinfo.dat.asc
the verified index, its signature and the lock; removed on purge. Downloaded
templates stay in their storage.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pveam (1),
.BR pct (1),
.BR pvesm (1),
.BR sqv (1)
